          "end": 13.95,
          "en": "with React and JavaScript, when working with React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.95,
          "end": 18.29,
          "en": "we often build so-called signal page applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.29,
          "end": 20.57,
          "en": "Because whilst we can use React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
