          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.58,
          "end": 39.32,
          "en": "which means that we use React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.32,
          "end": 41.5,
          "en": "for everything we see on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.5,
          "end": 44.37,
          "en": "and even for switching pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.37,
          "end": 47.84,
          "en": "So when we click on a link and we load a new page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.84,
          "end": 51.6,
          "en": "as I did with Netflix when I clicked on my list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.6,
          "end": 55.35,
          "en": "it looks to the user as if we switched the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.35,
          "end": 60.35,
          "en": "but actually don't request a new HTML file from some server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.94,
          "end": 65.71,
          "en": "instead, we just use the JavaScript through React.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.71,
          "end": 68.78999999999999,
          "en": "to change what's visible on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.78999999999999,
          "end": 71.23,
          "en": "And that often leads to a smoother UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.23,
          "end": 73.45,
          "en": "and a better user experience,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.45,
          "end": 76.28,
          "en": "as you see it at the example of Netflix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.28,
          "end": 77.72,
          "en": "It's built with React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.72,
          "end": 81.88,
          "en": "and there we never request a second HTML page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.88,
          "end": 84.42,
          "en": "hence it's a single page application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
